---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';
---

<Layout
  title={`Shipping Policy - ${SITE_NAME}`}
  description="Shipping policy for optional waterproof plastic allergy cards ordered through Open Allergy Cards."
>
  <section class="section prose-page">
    <h2>Shipping policy</h2>
    <p>
      Free digital allergy cards do not ship - you download or print them instantly. This policy
      covers optional physical plastic cards ordered through checkout.
    </p>
    <h3>Where we ship</h3>
    <p>
      We ship to countries enabled in Stripe Checkout. If your country is not listed, you can still
      use the free cards online and at home.
    </p>
    <h3>Timing</h3>
    <p>
      Production and delivery depend on our print partner and destination. After you order, we
      confirm timelines by email. We do not promise same-day shipping or use fake countdown timers.
    </p>
    <h3>Address accuracy</h3>
    <p>
      Please double-check your shipping address at checkout. We cannot redirect packages after they
      leave the printer if the address was entered incorrectly.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
      <a href="/contact">Contact us</a> · <a href="/order">Order a plastic card</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
